{"is_source_file": true, "format": "Python", "description": "This file is a backend implementation for an AI-powered chat application built with FastAPI. It integrates user authentication, chat handling, file uploads (text, JSON), in-memory and external vector indexing for retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), and communication with Google Gemini API for generating answers. The code includes endpoints for health checks, chat interactions, user registration/login, context file uploads (including PDF, DOCX, XLSX, TXT), JSON data ingestion, and session management. It maintains in-memory stores for conversation state, document chunks, JSON facts, and their embeddings, while also supporting optional external storage via Supabase. Significant functions handle text extraction, JSON flattening, semantic embedding, similarity retrieval in vector space, and response filtering to ensure concise, source-less answers.", "external_files": ["./auth_utils", "./chat_title", "./config_utils", "./json_utils", "./supabase_utils", "./file_utils"], "external_methods": ["create_tables", "get_db", "create_user", "get_user_by_username", "verify_password", "router as chat_title_router", "get_gemini_api_key", "flatten_json", "get_supabase_client", "insert_json_embeddings", "extract_text_from_bytes", "summarize_text_preview"], "published": ["health_check", "chat", "register", "login", "chat_wsinfo", "upload_chat_context", "upload_json_context"], "classes": [{"name": "ChatRequest", "description": "Schema for user's chat request, including session ID and query."}, {"name": "ChatAnswerResponse", "description": "Schema for API response containing the single answer string."}, {"name": "RegisterRequest", "description": "Schema for user registration input."}, {"name": "RegisterResponse", "description": "Schema for user registration output."}, {"name": "LoginRequest", "description": "Schema for user login input."}, {"name": "LoginResponse", "description": "Schema for user login output."}, {"name": "Up